{"id":"n66636-4-8","stage":0,"title":"받다 · 取得","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66636-4-8-1","ko":"이걸 점수라고 받은 거니?","zh":"这就是你考出来的分数？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이걸","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이걸","audio":"/audio/7f1cfc658d3e99fd2b27.mp3"}},{"text":"점수라고","meaning":"分数","explanation":"점수：分数；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"점수","audio":"/audio/276516218c1cd1275262.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70866","senseId":"1","lemma":"점수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"점수라고","audio":"/audio/800d44f362650f391b30.mp3"}},{"text":"받은","meaning":"取得，获得","explanation":"받다：取得，获得；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"4","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받은","audio":"/audio/135720fd9fd0e73d4239.mp3"}},{"text":"거니?","meaning":"所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）","explanation":"거：所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거니","audio":"/audio/3e0100c9477501692d3f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"276516218c1cd127","term":"점수","zh":"分数","audio":"/audio/276516218c1cd1275262.mp3","entryId":"70866","definition":"代表成绩的数字。","pronunciation":["점쑤","점수"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"取得，获得","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entry